      </div>

      <h2 id="best-suite-zoho">#4 — Zoho CRM (Best Value Suite)</h2>
      <p>Zoho CRM (and the Zoho One suite) is the best-value Salesforce alternative for teams that need a whole business suite (50+ apps at a budget. CRM, desk, projects, invoices, HR, campaigns, books all connected on one Zoho account. Zoho CRM Free tier even three users. At 30+ employees, Zoho One ~$45/user/mo for the entire suite beats Salesforce + 3rd-party replacements for SMB and mid-market teams want everything in one place. Large multichannel campaigns, CRM, creator apps: books, inventory, subscription billing — every SMB departments deploy the entire business to Zoho and drop 6–8 SaaS tools from their stack.</p>
      <p>Tradeoff: broad and deep. Individual products individually as solid per each product is not best-breed, but bundled breadth; at scale you give up some polish and UX clunkiness compared HubSpot and Pipedrive. pick when breadth-first everything one vendor want breadth price value matters.</p>

      <div class="product-box">
        <h2>Zoho CRM</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>50+ one suite apps</strong> — CRM, Books, Desk, Projects, People, Marketing, Cliq, etc., Zoho One</li>
          <li><strong>Free three users</strong> — 3 users free forever CRM tier includes email, pipelines, workflow rules</li>
          <li><strong>Unbeatable TCO</strong> — One per head entire business suite ~$45/user/month replaces multiple vendors</li>
          <li><strong>Zoho Creator &amp; Low-code</strong> — Custom low-code modules, portals, creator platform to build custom business apps</li>
          <li><strong>Zia AI</strong> — Zia predictive sales assistant, scoring, predictions, anomaly and deal alerts</li>
        </ul>
        <!-- Affiliate CTA position reserved -->
        <a href="https://www.zoho.com/crm/" class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow sponsored">Try Zoho CRM Free</a>
      </div>

      <h2 id="best-visual-monday">#5 — Monday Sales CRM (Best Visual Workflows & Automations)</h2>
      <p>Monday Sales CRM is the best Salesforce alternative for teams that need a combined sales + project workflow on one visual board. Monday built the Sales CRM product from Monday work OS, deals represented a Monday board with columns custom columns custom board views kanban timeline workflow maps visually Gantt + plus native automations no-code integrations pre-built boards Monday every product work apps. Sales reps see each deals one board custom columns stages. Project managers and sales leads don't have to bounce between Jira, Salesforce and sheets.</p>
